 "description": "An Invasion deck abusing We're In Attack Position Now, and Naboo Occupation.",
 "strategy": "This deck is meant to force choke, and cause large amounts of damage.  First turn, drop some cheap deploy droids down to the swamp and whatever site I pull, and Occupation.  Next turn I should be able to drain for 4 force.  Later, use the Flagship to pull Dofine, who pulls Activate the Droids.  We're In Attack Position Now causes direct damage for sites controlled by Commanders, which are why there are so many Tank Commanders.  Flip quickly, and drain for tons.  If all goes according to plan, I can do 17 damage a turn.  The deck benefits from large destinies, which are easy to draw with the flip side of the objective.",
